suggested_skill:
Replace all appearances of 'Subset(p)' with 'SUBSET p'. The 'SUBSET' keyword is the standard TLA+ operator to return the power set of a set. For example, change: 'Subset(p)' to 'SUBSET p'. Also, revise related expressions, e.g.

Old:
  WeightSet(p) == {Sum(S) : S \in Subset(p)}
New:
  WeightSet(p) == {Sum(S) : S \in SUBSET p}
